TVLWeightedContainers::updateContainer()
├── given invalid container parameters
│   └── it should inherit all validation tests from TVLWeightedContainersValidation
├── given container is active and new duration range conflicts
│   ├── when new duration min is greater than current duration
│   │   └── it should revert with TVLWeightedContainersInvalidInput
│   └── when new duration max is less than current duration
│       └── it should revert with TVLWeightedContainersInvalidInput
├── given valid parameters
│   ├── when updating inactive container
│   │   ├── it should preserve currentDurationEpochs from original container
│   │   ├── it should preserve inactive status from original container
│   │   ├── it should update container parameters with new values
│   │   ├── it should emit ContainerUpdated event with before and after
│   │   └── it should return the container ID
│   ├── when updating active container with valid duration range
│   │   ├── it should preserve active status and current duration
│   │   └── it should update other parameters correctly
│   ├── when updating with same duration range
│   │   └── it should update parameters even if duration range is identical
│   └── when updating non-existent container
│       └── it should revert
